      nursingEssentials: ["Read the complete microbiology report: organism, specimen/source, colony or culture context, MICs, carbapenemase phenotype or gene, and prior isolates. Escalate discordance between reported susceptibility and clinical deterioration.", "Protect new agents through exact dosing, infusion duration, source control, de-escalation, and infection-prevention measures because underexposure and unnecessary continuation accelerate resistance."],
